&lt;li&gt;Promote value-based technical selling, empowering teams to deliver impactful business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Global Influence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
