&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Sales Engineering, Solutions Architecture, or similar pre-sales leadership roles, with multiple years of SE leadership experience or second line leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in enterprise SaaS, cloud, observability, AI, and security solutions, with a track record of driving technical sales success at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
